  "system_architecture": "{\"overview\":\"A shared harness (window gate, dedupe, single-flight, ordering, run-row writer) hosts seven small feeders in two venues. Host feeders authenticate once through child C's getAuthenticatedClient and talk to Calendar, Gmail (metadata reads, bounded modify) and Drive through import-time-pure clients. The GHA feeder talks only to Todoist with the existing token. The seat closes the queue the feeders leave (class null, effort_grade null) through a provenance-checked recorder that writes metering. Child E consumes the harness's ordering predicate for assembly; child G consumes the run rows for gauges.\",\"components\":[{\"name\":\"lib/michael/feeder.mjs\",\"responsibility\":\"runFeeder harness, window helpers, assembleReadiness predicate\",\"technology\":\"ESM, lib/michael/db.mjs, lib/time/chairman-et-wall-clock.js\"},{\"name\":\"lib/michael/rules-match.mjs\",\"responsibility\":\"Pure matching over michael_rules.rule_json for gmail, todoist role tags and tasks buckets\",\"technology\":\"ESM pure functions\"},{\"name\":\"lib/michael/google-clients.mjs + gmail-client.mjs extension + constants.mjs\",\"responsibility\":\"Calendar events.list, Drive files list/read, Gmail threads.list/getThreadMeta/labels.list on the chairman grant; env-resolved chairman constants\",\"technology\":\"googleapis (lazy), google-auth-library via chairman-oauth.js\"},{\"name\":\"scripts/michael/calendar-read.mjs, gmail-triage.mjs, tasks-classifier.mjs\",\"responsibility\":\"Host feeders (task_scheduler venue)\",\"technology\":\"ESM CLIs in the michael-family shape\"},{\"name\":\"scripts/michael/todoist-brief.mjs + .github/workflows/michael-todoist-brief-cron.yml\",\"responsibility\":\"GHA feeder and its both-DST cron workflow\",\"technology\":\"@doist/todoist-api-typescript via createTodoistClient; GitHub Actions\"},{\"name\":\"scripts/setup-michael-host-tasks.mjs + scripts/cron/michael-*-task.cmd\",\"responsibility\":\"Host registrar in the setup-alarm-cron-tasks shape with hidden launch\",\"technology\":\"schtasks, wscript run-hidden.vbs\"},{\"name\":\"scripts/michael/queue-read.mjs, classify-apply.mjs\",\"responsibility\":\"Seat verbs: queue reader and provenance-checked recorder writing metering\",\"technology\":\"ESM CLIs, canonicalJson/sha256Hex from db.mjs\"}],\"data_flow\":\"03:45 tasks-classifier (host): Drive current-tasks.json -> rules buckets -> Todoist create / staged items -> feeder_runs. 04:00 calendar-read (host): events.list x2 -> michael_calendar_day -> classification in counts. 04:30 gmail-triage (host): labels.list -> michael_gmail_labels; threads.list -> getThreadMeta -> rules -> michael_gmail_triage_items (intent) -> modifyThread -> action_taken_at, ceiling-bounded; unmatched class null. 04:45 todoist-brief (gha): getTasks -> filter -> grade Est -> michael_todoist_snapshot; auto_apply rules -> mutations_applied. Seat tick (04:30-07:30): queue-read -> Sonnet/Opus sub-agents at the seat -> runner-produced verdict file -> classify-apply -> item/task rows + seat feeder_runs with metering. 05:15+ child E assemble reads assembleReadiness over feeder_runs.\",\"integration_points\":[\"lib/integrations/google/chairman-oauth.js getAuthenticatedClient (child C)\",\"lib/michael/gmail-client.mjs modifyThread (child C) and its new read methods\",\"lib/michael/db.mjs readRows/writeRows/refusal/emit/canonicalJson/sha256Hex (child B)\",\"scripts/michael-quiet-tick.mjs window helpers and QUIET_TICK_CLASSIFY_QUEUE line (child A)\",\"database/migrations/20260906_michael_tables.sql natural keys and CHECKs (child B, chairman-applied)\",\"lib/integrations/todoist/todoist-sync.js createTodoistClient; chairman-notify.js DEFAULT_PROJECT_ID (never called)\",\"scripts/setup-alarm-cron-tasks.mjs and setup-eva-watcher-task.mjs builders; scripts/cron/run-hidden.vbs\",\"Child E imports assembleReadiness; child G reads feeder_runs and writes the handoff seam\"]}",
